     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>Can we have cron Jobs in shiny <a href=\"http://app.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://app.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361100537000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0k2BikvJZoV0HNS3Z5ISpM\">app.io</a>? I have a shiny app in which one of the script needs to run daily once so that the data in the app can be updated from the database. </div><div><br></div><div>I know in shinyserver - we can have CRON jobs. But how to schedule scripts in <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361100537000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3O0Q7qQ9lZjG1ZWWx6aE9U\">shinyapps.io</a>??</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks!</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
